CurrencyRaisedAtPriceTest
├── when demandAtPrice is 0
│   └── it returns 0
├── when demandAbovePrice covers totalCurrencyRaised
│   └── it returns 0
├── when bids at clearing are partially filled
│   └── it returns only what remains after bids above clearing are accounted for
├── when bids at clearing are capped by rounded up price
│   └── it returns demandAtPrice * deltaMps
└── it never exceeds demandAtPrice * deltaMps (fuzz)
